{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56213","headline":"六十甲子歌（题拟） 五十三 · 杜光庭","name":"六十甲子歌（题拟） 五十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丙辰於，禾苗种陆衢。\n安泰在濠楚，齐晋受殃殂。\n亦复多灾水，鹿兔杂羣鱼。\n是处民乏食，仓库悉空虚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56213.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56213","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}